# Customer Ledger APIs

### Base URL

```http
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@access_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwMDIwNTIyLCJpYXQiOjE3ODk5OTE3MjIsImp0aSI6IjgyMGQ1MGQ3MGI5NjRlMjQ4ZDc4MTRkZWE5MDU4NjQ2IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6MiwiaXNfc3VwZXJhZG1pbiI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyX2FkbWluIjp0cnVlLCJpc19lbXBsb3llZSI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyIjpmYWxzZX0.ZQNQzbK-cP4CHcaIHtLZD4h9HlybYI9jCCq2dvsdp5I
@customer_id = CUSTOMER_ID
```

---

### 1. List All Ledger Entries

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 2. Get Customer Ledger

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ledger/customer/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

## 3. Get Customer Ledger with Date Filter

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 4. Filter by Transaction Type — Invoice

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?transaction_type=invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 5. Filter by Transaction Type — Payment

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?transaction_type=payment
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 6. Filter by Transaction Type — Opening Balance

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?transaction_type=opening_balance
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 7. Search Ledger

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/?search=SEARCH_VALUE
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 8. Order Ledger — Oldest First

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/?ordering=transaction_date
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 9. Order Ledger — Newest First

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/?ordering=-transaction_date
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 10. Customer Ledger Summary

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/summary/?customer_id={{customer_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 11. Customer Ledger Summary with Date Filter

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/summary/?customer_id={{customer_id}}&from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 12. Customer Ledger — Date + Transaction Type

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30&transaction_type=invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 13. Customer Ledger — Date + Search

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30&search=INV001
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

## 14. Customer Ledger — Pagination

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```
